  "Drop the copy on the side of the box and they join into one box.",
  "Here\u2019s what I\u2019d do. I\u2019d drop the box on the robot. Then I\u2019d have it set the box on Mimi, take the copy, and drop the copy on the side of the box. When I leave its thought bubble, I\u2019d give it the box and let it work \u2014 then give the bird the box it made."
